  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">ROOTS IN KERALA / BUILDING IN THE UK</p><h1 id="hero-title">FROM<br/><em>KERALA.</em><br/>TO THE UK<span>.</span></h1>
  <p class="intro">I'm <strong>Adeep Aji</strong>, a Malayali fitness trainer originally from Kerala, India, now based in the United Kingdom. I created BF GYM Global to make learning about strength, exercise and consistent fitness habits simpler and more approachable.</p>
  <p class="malayalam" lang="ml">കേരളത്തിൽ നിന്ന് യുകെയിലേക്ക് — ഫിറ്റ്നസ് എല്ലാവർക്കും.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/trainer/">MEET COACH ADEEP ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/start/">START FREE FITNESS LEARNING ↗</a><a class="share-link" href="https://wa.me/?text=Kerala%20roots%2C%20UK%20based!%20Explore%20BF%20GYM%20Global%2C%20free%20fitness%20learning%20created%20by%20Malayali%20trainer%20Coach%20Adeep%20Aji%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbfgym.netlify.app%2Fkerala-uk%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SHARE ON WHATSAPP ↗</a></div>
