</section>
<div class="ribbon"><span>MALAYALI FOUNDED</span><b>✳</b><span>UK BASED</span><b>✳</b><span>FREE FITNESS EDUCATION</span></div>
<section class="story wrap">
 <div class="heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / WHY BF GYM GLOBAL</p><h2>A COMMUNITY<br/><em>WITHOUT BORDERS.</em></h2></div>
 <div class="story-copy"><p>Moving countries can mean new routines, new work patterns and less time for exercise. BF GYM Global is built around practical fitness education you can explore on your own schedule — including strength training, gentle cardio, recovery and learning good movement technique.</p><p>For Malayalis living in London and across the UK, this is a fitness platform built by someone who shares Kerala roots. The free learning resources are designed to be useful to anybody, whatever their background or location.</p><p class="note">BF GYM Global is currently a free educational project. Coaching appointments, paid membership, registration and Wallet passes are not active.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="resources" aria-labelledby="resources-title"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">02 / EXPLORE THE PLATFORM</p><div class="section-head"><h2 id="resources-title">YOUR NEXT<br/><em>FITNESS STEP.</em></h2><p>Free tools and a future membership-card concept — no joining fees or paid bookings.</p></div><div class="resource-grid">{resources.map(r=><a class="resource" href={r.url}><span class="number">{r.no} / BF GYM GLOBAL</span><h3>{r.title}</h3><strong>{r.sub}</strong><p>{r.body}</p><span class="resource-action">{r.action} ↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="why wrap" aria-labelledby="why-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / WORKING WITH PURPOSE</p><h2 id="why-heading">THE FOUNDER<br/><em>BEHIND THE IDEA.</em></h2></div><div><p>Coach Adeep's earlier fitness experience includes one-to-one and small-group personal training in India. His training history includes certificates covering personal training, women's fitness, special-population fitness and historical CPR/AED courses. Supporting copies have been reviewed, but issuing organisations have not independently confirmed authenticity.</p><p>No award or expiry dates are displayed here. Historical certificates are not presented as current professional registrations.</p><a href="/trainer/" class="text-link">READ THE FULL TRAINER PROFILE ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL IDEA. A GLOBAL MINDSET.</p><h2>TRAIN SMART.<br/><em>GROW TOGETHER.</em></h2><p>Free fitness learning from a UK-based, Kerala-rooted creator.</p></div><a class="btn dark-btn" href="/app/">OPEN BF GYM GLOBAL ↗</a></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer wrap"><a href="/">BF<span>.</span> GYM GLOBAL</a><p>KERALA ROOTS · UK BASED · OPEN TO EVERYONE</p><div><a href="/privacy/">PRIVACY</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/fitwithaadhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Follow Coach Adeep on Instagram">INSTAGRAM @FITWITHAADHI</a><a href="/trainer/">TRAINER</a></div></footer>
